"- Adjusting the spacing between words to produce tighter or looser "
"paragraphs."
msgstr ""
"- Adjusting the spacing between words to produce tighter or looser "
"paragraphs."

msgid ""
"- Adjusting the tracking of the text. This is the overall spacing of the "
"letters in a paragraph or on a line. With a good font in justified paragraphs"
" this can usually be adjusted by up to -25 or +15 without it looking too out "
"of place."
msgstr ""
"- Adjusting the tracking of the text. This is the overall spacing of the "
"letters in a paragraph or on a line. With a good font in justified paragraphs"
" this can usually be adjusted by up to -25 or +15 without it looking too out "
"of place."

msgid "- Adjusting the hyphenation of words within the paragraph."
msgstr "- Adjusting the hyphenation of words within the paragraph."

msgid "- Forcing a word down onto the next line using a soft return."
msgstr "- Forcing a word down onto the next line using a soft return."

